	(text "APPROVED PASSIVES (reused across all sheets: same value + rating + operating voltage = same MPN)\nCAP-0603-100N-50V-X7R    x51  CL10B104KB8NNNC (Samsung Electro-Mechanics)  |  alt: C0603C104K5RACTU (KEMET), GCJ188R71H104KA12D (Murata), 885012206095 (Wurth Elektronik)\nCAP-0603-39N-50V-X7R     x1   CL10B393KB8NNNC (Samsung Electro-Mechanics)  |  alt: CC0603KRX7R9BB393 (Yageo), 06035C393KAT2A (KYOCERA AVX), GCJ188R71H393KA12D (Murata)\nCAP-0603-330N-16V-X7R    x1   CL10B334KO8NNNC (Samsung Electro-Mechanics)  |  alt: C1608X7R1C334K080AC (TDK), C0603C334K4RACTU (KEMET), AC0603KRX7R7BB334 (Yageo)\nCAP-0805-10U-25V-X5R     x1   GRM21BR61E106KA73L (Murata)  |  alt: CL21A106KAYNNNE (Samsung Electro-Mechanics), C2012X5R1E106K085AC (TDK), CC0805KRX5R8BB106 (Yageo)\nRES-0603-10K-5%-0.1W     x27  RC0603JR-0710KL (Yageo)  |  alt: ERJ-3GEYJ103V (Panasonic), CRCW060310K0JNEA (Vishay Dale), CR0603-JW-103ELF (Bourns)\nDerating rules: C applied V <= 50% of rated, dielectric Tmax >= Tamb+20C; R power <= 50% of derated rating at 85C, V <= 80% of max working V\nC1 (X5R, 85C max) FAILS the temperature rule at Tamb 85C: test-bench only, not part of any block" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a335cc1-63fb-4c89-bf55-97e9cbd8007c"))
